[I] Library implementing the EBU R128 loudness standard

[T] libebur128 is a C library that implements the EBU R 128 standard for
[T] loudness normalisation. It measures momentary, short-term and integrated
[T] loudness, loudness range and sample or true peak values, and is used by
[T] audio tools for ReplayGain-style normalisation.

[U] https://github.com/jiixyj/libebur128

[A] Libebur128 Authors
